{"overview":"تاکاتو، روکی و لی کودکانی‌اند که به‌سرنوشت، دیجی‌مون‌های واقعی دریافت کرده‌اند، نه همان دیجی‌مون‌های خیالی کارت‌ بازی که می‌کردند. هر یک از این «تامین‌کنندگان دیجی‌مون» دیدگاه متفاوتی دربارهٔ نحوهٔ رفتار با دیجی‌مون‌ها دارند، اما وقتی دیجی‌مون‌های دیگر در سراسر ژاپن ظاهر می‌شوند، باید اختلافاتشان را کنار بگذارند تا از این مهاجمان دیجیتالی دفاع کنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Takato, Ruki, and Lee are children who have, by fate, received real Digimon, unlike the imaginary ones in the card game they play. Each of the children, or Digimon Tamers, have their different views on how Digimon should be treated. But when other Digimon begin to appear around Japan, they must put aside their differences to fend off the digital intruders.","tagline_en":"","runtime":25,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":51,"y":2001,"poster":"/mqXtrC1JeGykKbvbyF9B8RTMvn0.jpg"}],"episodes":51,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"津村まこと","role":"Takato Matsuda (voice)","photo":"/81DYZwZ4M7Atf6w5Zk1e18QeIW8.jpg","en":"Makoto Tsumura"},{"name":"野沢雅子","role":"Guilmon / Narrator (voice)","photo":"/jxbXdejmPoiKnNoQz7Dkb80qC26.jpg","en":"Masako Nozawa"},{"name":"折笠富美子","role":"Ruki Makino (voice)","photo":"/f5d1J13fksa1hK8u7AS95aO8b9.jpg","en":"Fumiko Orikasa"},{"name":"یوکا ایمای","role":"Renamon (voice)","photo":"/SivuDZuk3GsYVm9kYdSKcnQQ9I.jpg","en":"Yuka Imai"},{"name":"山口眞弓","role":"Li Jianliang (voice)","photo":"/uzkuXAZqQhbW03ELeLpmjcIzGpS.jpg","en":"Mayumi Yamaguchi"},{"name":"آوی تادا","role":"Terriermon (voice)","photo":"/41TErIWmyAjeiuyCRTBG7UhSzBh.jpg","en":"Aoi Tada"},{"name":"金田朋子","role":"Culumon (voice)","photo":"/oj2f7KpJLas78N19GvBS41ydZCa.jpg","en":"Tomoko Kaneda"},{"name":"浅田葉子","role":"Juri Katou (voice)","photo":"/mAyuP7DVw9Nri1qWHltwzB3xHXT.jpg","en":"Yoko Asada"}],"trailer":"","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/9302/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png